1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,098
Both pictures bend the light the same way.

2
00:00:03,098 --> 00:00:06,484
But they make opposite predictions about its speed in water.

3
00:00:06,484 --> 00:00:08,567
Newton says faster.

4
00:00:08,567 --> 00:00:10,325
Huygens says slower.

5
00:00:10,325 --> 00:00:12,213
Someone just had to measure it.

